 e country as they effect authors\, writers and lovers of the written word\
 , and how these same groups can fight back.\nSisters in Crime is the premi
 er crime writing association focused on representing and advocating for wo
 men crime writers. With over 4\,500 members nationwide\, Sisters in Crime 
 is committed to maintaining a supportive community of fellow writers and r
 eaders\, both peers to share the peaks and valleys of writing\, and mentor
 s to model the way forward.\nRegister here
